---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="How to reach vhsgreed: email for commissions, data questions, and partnership inquiries. We reply to everything relevant.">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Contact</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Commissions, data questions, or partnership ideas. We reply to
        everything relevant.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:lillerik.sund@gmail.com">lillerik.sund@gmail.com</a>
      </p>

      <h2>What we take on</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Custom web scraping and data-extraction services (probe-first, honest delivery limits).</li>
        <li>Data product commissions: ticker universes, exposure maps, research snapshots.</li>
        <li>AI agent tooling and automation work.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell data we do not have, promise scrapes of sites that
        block us, or take work we cannot verify. If we cannot do the job
        honestly, we say so before you pay.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>